.TH MISSIONPLANNER-AVALONIA 1 "August 2026" "MissionPlanner Avalonia" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
missionplanner-avalonia \- ground control station for ArduPilot vehicles
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B missionplanner-avalonia
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
MissionPlanner Avalonia is a cross-platform port of Mission Planner for flight
planning, telemetry, parameter management, log analysis, simulation, and vehicle
setup.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/MissionPlannerAvalonia
User configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/MissionPlannerAvalonia
Logs and persistent user data.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/MissionPlannerAvalonia
Downloaded terrain, SITL, parameter, and update caches.
.SH SEE ALSO
.UR https://github.com/sema-aviation/MissionPlanner-Avalonia
Project home page
.UE
